      "value": "Small workaround:\n\nwrite a one line which executes steamcmd to download VRChat (with a specific Beta/Branch) into a specific Folder. Than just start if from the folder or use VRC Quick Launcher to start it.\n\nsomething like `steamcmd.exe +force_install_dir . +login SteamUsername \"SteamPassword\" +app_update 438100 -beta open-beta validate +quit` for open-beta branch or `steamcmd.exe +force_install_dir . +login SteamUsername \"SteamPassword\" +app_update 438100 validate +quit` for live (no beta)\n\nIn VRC Quick Launcher you can choose them from drop down",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
