      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{60e65f577ae9d0492b0f2a75|full_name}: Was already using SteamCMD (found it shortly after posting this) and it works for now. I added the beta to Steam as a non-steam game as well, which lets me launch it directly and in VR.\n\nYou also don't need your password in the login script if you've already authenticated SteamCMD with your account. It's just \"login username\".\n\nI also used a folder called \"VRChat (BETA)\" in the main Steam SteamApps directory as the force_install_dir to keep it organized.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
