  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "As it stands, technical enthusiasts and content creators, eager to test their content in the latest builds, are forced to swap back-and-forth between beta builds and the live release.\n\nHowever, on Quest, (*due to peculiarities with Meta's build channel system*), the beta channel is listed as a separate application. **This is a net positive to users.**\n\nPlease bring this same method of release to the Steam store and PC platform.\n\n# Benefits include:\n\n- Side by Side testing (the ability to test content in Release & Beta simultaneously)\n\n- Rapid testing of Beta features\n\n- Reduced friction in testing builds\n\n# Additional\n\n- It has been suggested that the beta be provided as a child app of the main VRChat listing, [as mentioned in the VRChat Discord](https://discord.com/channels/189511567539306508/449386885299830794/1146446582959579158)\n\n- **Official Steam Documentation on the feature:** [Steam Playtest](https://partner.steamgames.com/doc/features/playtest)",
